      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name} Update: This bug was reintroduced in the latest version of VRChat. Contacts with 'Allow Self' disabled were recently working as intended, but this bug has returned shortly after the Feburary 14th update.\n\nAfter the update, contacts with 'Allow Self' unticked will react to the local avatar by setting its target parameter to zero upon contact.",
